OL,3,GNEWSAAirline and ferry company boss
OL,4,Aresigns from role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry and airline company boss has
OL,7,Fannounced he will be stepping down from
OL,8,Fhis role early next year.
OL,10,FThe Isles of Scilly Steamship Group
OL,11,F(ISSG) said its chief executive Stuart
OL,12,FReid had tendered his resignation in
OL,13,Forder to take up a new job in the
OL,14,Ftransport sector, with his last day set
OL,15,Fto be on 16 February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
