OL,3,GNEWSAAirline and ferry company boss
OL,4,Aresigns from role
OL,5,
OL,6,FReid has been in his current role for
OL,7,Fseven years - airline Skybus has faced
OL,8,Fcriticism in recent months over its
OL,9,Fhandling of services to and from the
OL,10,FIsles of Scilly, including the
OL,11,Fcancellation of flights during the
OL,12,Fsummer.
OL,14,FA statement from the ISSG said Reid
OL,15,Fwould remain focused on delivering its
OL,16,Fpriorities while the recruitment of his
OL,17,Fsuccessor took place.
